OL,4,BDeChambeau joins DP World Tour after   
OL,5,BLIV Golf collapse                      
OL,6,GTwo-time US Open champion Bryson       
OL,7,GDeChambeau has agreed to join the DP   
OL,8,GWorld Tour for next season.            
OL,10,FDeChambeau was among a host of star    
OL,11,Fnames who joined LIV Golf four years   
OL,12,Fago and maintained his commitment even 
OL,13,Fafter Saudi Arabia's Public Investment 
OL,14,FFund withdrew its financial backing    
OL,15,Ffor the breakaway tour in April.       
OL,17,FEarlier this month the 33-year-old     
OL,18,FAmerican said he "gave everything" to  
OL,19,Fkeep LIV Golf alive as the tour        
OL,20,Fconfirmed its intention to wind down   
OL,21,Foperations.                            
